a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杂画册叶八首 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"云出山顶合，云归洞口封。\n地深人不到，白日下双龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":36951,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杂画册叶八首 其五","author":"孙承恩","text":"月出大江口，乾坤一钓船。\n洞箫声起处，惊醒老龙眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":36952,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杂画册叶八首 其六","author":"孙承恩","text":"习静山中处，孤吟绝往还。\n晓烟收尽处，坐见隔江山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":36953,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杂画册叶八首 其七","author":"孙承恩","text":"膴膴川原合，依依桑柘疏。\n柳汀与花坞，好是辋川居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":36954,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杂画册叶八首 其八","author":"孙承恩","text":"山头出白云，瀑布洒飞雨。\n可人期不来，目断潇湘浦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":36955,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景册为唐饬轩题 其一 渔庄鸣榔","author":"孙承恩","text":"湖光映层甍，朝来晴可渔。\n时有冶游人，隔花呼买鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":36956,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景册为唐饬轩题 其二 曲院风荷","author":"孙承恩","text":"虚阁极萧爽，菡萏摇清漪